Subject: util/rand_xor: use /dev/urandom fallback on Android (Termux)

Termux's libc (bionic) lacks the getrandom() prototype even though meson's
pkg-config check sets HAVE_GETRANDOM. On Android force the /dev/urandom
fallback (src/util/rand_xor.c already implements it for !HAVE_GETRANDOM).

Applied by build_termux.sh (python string patch); this file is the reference.

--- a/src/util/rand_xor.c
+++ b/src/util/rand_xor.c
@@
 #include "detect_os.h"

+#if defined(__ANDROID__) && defined(HAVE_GETRANDOM)
+#undef HAVE_GETRANDOM
+#endif
+
 #if !DETECT_OS_WINDOWS
